  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(i)&nbsp; Emulsion is liquid in liquid type colloid.</p><p>(ii)&nbsp; For adsorption,<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>(iii)&nbsp; Smaller the size and less viscous the dispersion medium, more will be the Brownian motion.</p><p>(iv)&nbsp; Higher the&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub></math>,&nbsp;greater will be the extent of adsorption.</p>",
